> same source code. Is anyone else also interested?

What editors are you talking about? EDT is the editor under RSTS/E and 
RSX, but I didn't think it was used under RT-11. But most of the source 
code for EDT is shared between all DEC OSes. EDT is written in Bliss, by 
the way.

