> run RSX-11 at all), I will make no additional comments on aspects
> which fit RT-11 quite well, but which have no place in RSX-11 at
> the present time.

Running RSX is easy. However, it does put totally different restrictions 
at your feet than RT-11. But on the other hand, it also gives you 
totally different capabilities than RT-11. It's a different type of 
shoe. If you are in an RT-11 mindset, RSX is going to be difficult, yes. 
But so will any OS, since it's OSes like RT-11 which are the odd one out.

	Johnny


